      "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"it\" dir=\"ltr\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r3394793\">.mw-parser-output .messagebox{border:1px solid #a2a9b1;background-color:#f8f9fa;width:80%;margin:0 auto 1em auto;padding:.2em}.mw-parser-output .messagebox.merge{border:1px solid #c0b8cc;background-color:#f0e5ff;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .messagebox.cleanup{border:1px solid #9f9fff;background-color:#efefff;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output .messagebox.standard-talk{border:1px solid #c0c090;background-color:#f8eaba;margin:4px auto}.mw-parser-output .mbox-inside .standard-talk,.mw-parser-output .messagebox.nested-talk{border:1px solid #c0c090;background-color:#f8eaba;width:100%;margin:2px 0;padding:2px}.mw-parser-output .messagebox.small{width:238px;font-size:85%;float:right;clear:both;margin:0 0 1em 1em;line-height:1.25em}.mw-parser-output .messagebox.small-talk{width:238px;font-size:85%;float:right;clear:both;margin:0 0 1em 1em;line-height:1.25em;background-color:#F8EABA}.mw-parser-output th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output td.mbox-text{border:none;padding:0.25em 0.9em;width:100%}.mw-parser-output td.mbox-image{border:none;padding:2px 0 2px 0.9em;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output td.mbox-imageright{border:none;padding:2px 0.9em 2px 0;text-align:center}.mw-parser-output td.mbox-empty-cell{border:none;padding:0;width:1px}</style>\n<style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r3396280\">.mw-parser-output table.ambox{margin:0 10%;border:1px solid #a2a9b1;border-left:10px solid #36c;background-color:#fbfbfb;box-sizing:border-box}.mw-parser-output table.ambox+table.ambox{margin-top:-1px}.mw-parser-output .ambox th.mbox-text,.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-text{padding:0.25em 0.5em}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-image{padding:2px 0 2px 0.5em}.mw-parser-output .ambox td.mbox-imageright{padding:2px 0.5em 2px 0}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-notice{border-left:10px solid #36c}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-speedy{border-left:10px solid #b32424;background-color:#fee7e6}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-delete{border-left:10px solid #b32424}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-content{border-left:10px solid #f28500}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-style{border-left:10px solid #fc3}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-move{border-left:10px solid #9932cc}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-protection{border-left:10px solid #a2a9b1}.mw-parser-output table.ambox-altro{border-left:10px solid #32cd32}</style>\n<table class=\"plainlinks metadata ambox ambox-style\" role=\"presentation\"><tbody><tr><td class=\"mbox-image\"><div style=\"width:52px\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/40px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f2/Edit-clear.svg/120px-Edit-clear.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></span></span></div></td><td class=\"mbox-text\"><div class=\"mbox-text-span\">Questo lemma  non \u00e8 ancora \"<a href=\"/wiki/Aiuto:Wikificare\" title=\"Aiuto:Wikificare\">wikificato</a>\", ovvero <a href=\"/wiki/Wikizionario:Guida_essenziale\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wikizionario:Guida essenziale\">formattato</a> secondo gli <a href=\"/wiki/Wikizionario:Manuale_di_stile\" title=\"Wikizionario:Manuale di stile\">standard</a> di Wikizionario (vedi l'<a href=\"/wiki/Categoria:Da_wikificare\" title=\"Categoria:Da wikificare\">elenco dei lemmi da wikificare</a>). <br /> <b>Motivo:</b>  dividere le traduzioni e le informazioni aggiuntive in base alla definizione a cui si riferiscono.\n<hr />\n<div style=\"font-size:90%;\"><a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://it.wiktionary.org/w/index.php?title=ancora&amp;action=edit\">Contribuisci</a> a migliorarlo seguendo le <a href=\"/wiki/Aiuto:Wikificare\" title=\"Aiuto:Wikificare\">linee guida</a> e quindi rimuovi questo avviso.</div></div></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<meta property=\"mw:PageProp/toc\" />\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading2\"><h2 id=\"Italiano\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Flag_of_Italy.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"bandiera italiana\"><img alt=\"bandiera italiana\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/40px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"27\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/03/Flag_of_Italy.svg/120px-Flag_of_Italy.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"1500\" data-file-height=\"1000\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Appendice:Italiano\" title=\"Appendice:Italiano\">Italiano</a></h2><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ancora&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Italiano\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Avverbio\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Open_book_01.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/40px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/60px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a></span><i><a href=\"/wiki/avverbio\" title=\"avverbio\">Avverbio</a></i></h3></div> \n<p><b>ancora</b><small></small>\n</p>\n<ol><li>un'<a href=\"/wiki/altra\" title=\"altra\">altra</a> <a href=\"/wiki/volta\" title=\"volta\">volta</a>\n<ul><li><i>suonala <b>ancora</b><small></small></i></li></ul></li>\n<li><small>(<i>per estensione</i>)</small> <a href=\"/wiki/ulteriormente\" title=\"ulteriormente\">ulteriormente</a></li>\n<li>esprime <a href=\"/wiki/continuit%C3%A0\" title=\"continuit\u00e0\">continuit\u00e0</a> nel <a href=\"/wiki/tempo\" title=\"tempo\">tempo</a>\n<ul><li><i>qui c'\u00e8 <b>ancora</b><small></small> molto da fare</i>, resta molto da fare</li></ul></li>\n<li>nelle frasi negative ha il significato di <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=sinora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"sinora (la pagina non esiste)\">sinora</a>, intendendo che l'<a href=\"/wiki/evento\" title=\"evento\">evento</a> <a href=\"/wiki/non\" title=\"non\">non</a> \u00e8 <a href=\"/wiki/avvenuto\" title=\"avvenuto\">avvenuto</a> <a href=\"/wiki/ma\" title=\"ma\">ma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/dovrebbe\" title=\"dovrebbe\">dovrebbe</a> <a href=\"/wiki/avvenire\" title=\"avvenire\">avvenire</a>\n<ul><li><i>non sono <b>ancora</b><small></small> arrivato</i></li></ul></li></ol>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Elbe_2009_-CUX_25_Elvstint_(ship,_1963)-_by-RaBoe_12.jpg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Elbe_2009_-CUX_25_Elvstint_%28ship%2C_1963%29-_by-RaBoe_12.jpg/250px-Elbe_2009_-CUX_25_Elvstint_%28ship%2C_1963%29-_by-RaBoe_12.jpg?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"333\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9e/Elbe_2009_-CUX_25_Elvstint_%28ship%2C_1963%29-_by-RaBoe_12.jpg/500px-Elbe_2009_-CUX_25_Elvstint_%28ship%2C_1963%29-_by-RaBoe_12.jpg?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"600\" data-file-height=\"800\" /></a><figcaption>un'ancora su un'imbarcazione</figcaption></figure>\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lanterna_di_Genova-Ancora-IMG_2562.JPG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Lanterna_di_Genova-Ancora-IMG_2562.JPG/250px-Lanterna_di_Genova-Ancora-IMG_2562.JPG?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"188\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6c/Lanterna_di_Genova-Ancora-IMG_2562.JPG/500px-Lanterna_di_Genova-Ancora-IMG_2562.JPG?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1944\" /></a><figcaption>un'ancora appoggiata sulla <a href=\"/wiki/terraferma\" title=\"terraferma\">terraferma</a></figcaption></figure>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sostantivo\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Open_book_01.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/40px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/60px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a></span><i><a href=\"/wiki/sostantivo\" title=\"sostantivo\">Sostantivo</a></i></h3></div> \n<p><b>ancora</b><small>&#160;(<span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Wikipedia\"><img alt=\"Wikipedia\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/20px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/80/Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg/40px-Wikipedia-logo-v2.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"103\" data-file-height=\"94\" /></a></span> <b><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/ancora\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:ancora\">approfondimento</a></b>)</small> <i>f sing</i> (<i>pl.</i>: <a href=\"/wiki/ancore\" title=\"ancore\">ancore</a>) \n</p>\n<ol><li><small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/marina\" title=\"marina\">marina</a></i>)</small> pesante oggetto <a href=\"/wiki/metallico\" title=\"metallico\">metallico</a> legato ad una <a href=\"/wiki/imbarcazione\" title=\"imbarcazione\">imbarcazione</a> e fatto scendere sul <a href=\"/wiki/fondale\" title=\"fondale\">fondale</a> per evitare gli effetti <a href=\"/wiki/trascinanti\" title=\"trascinanti\">trascinanti</a> della <a href=\"/wiki/corrente\" title=\"corrente\">corrente</a> marina</li>\n<li><small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/araldica\" title=\"araldica\">araldica</a></i>)</small> figura araldica convenzionale rappresentata, di norma, con <a href=\"/wiki/stanga\" title=\"stanga\">stanga</a>, la <a href=\"/wiki/trabe\" title=\"trabe\">trabe</a> e la <a href=\"/wiki/gomena\" title=\"gomena\">gomena</a>; con quattro bracci e senza ceppo \u00e8 <a href=\"/wiki/graffio\" title=\"graffio\">graffio</a> o <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=raffio&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"raffio (la pagina non esiste)\">raffio</a>; l'ancora pu\u00f2 anche essere utilizzata come ornamento esteriore dello scudo per indicare l'appartenenza del titolare ai ranghi pi\u00f9 elevati della marina</li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Voce_verbale\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Open_book_01.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/40px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Open_book_01.svg/60px-Open_book_01.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"360\" data-file-height=\"360\" /></a></span><i><a href=\"/wiki/voce_verbale\" title=\"voce verbale\">Voce verbale</a></i></h3></div> \n<p><b>ancora</b><small></small>\n</p>\n<ol><li>terza persona singolare dell'indicativo presente di <a href=\"/wiki/ancorare\" title=\"ancorare\">ancorare</a></li>\n<li>seconda persona singolare dell'imperativo di <a href=\"/wiki/ancorare\" title=\"ancorare\">ancorare</a></li></ol>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sillabazione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Hyph_abc.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/60px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"45\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/7/7f/Hyph_abc.svg/120px-Hyph_abc.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"512\" data-file-height=\"260\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/sillabazione\" title=\"sillabazione\">Sillabazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-sill-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Sillabazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><i>(avverbio)</i> <b>an | c\u00f3 | ra</b></li>\n<li><i>(sostantivo)</i> <b>\u00e0n | co | ra</b></li>\n<li><i>(voce verbale)</i> <b>\u00e0n | co | ra</b></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Pronuncia\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg/40px-Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg/60px-Nuvola_apps_edu_languages.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/pronuncia\" title=\"pronuncia\">Pronuncia</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-pron-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Pronuncia\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dd><i>(avverbio)</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Aiuto:IPA\" title=\"Aiuto:IPA\">AFI</a>: <span class=\"IPA\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Calibri&#39;, &#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;, &#39;Charis SIL&#39;, &#39;Doulos SIL&#39;, &#39;Gentium Plus&#39;, Gentium, GentiumAlt, &#39;Lucida Grande&#39;, &#39;Arial Unicode MS&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 110%;\">/a\u014b\u02c8kora/</span></dd>\n<dd><i>(sostantivo)</i> <a href=\"/wiki/Aiuto:IPA\" title=\"Aiuto:IPA\">AFI</a>: <span class=\"IPA\" style=\"font-family:&#39;Segoe UI&#39;, &#39;Calibri&#39;, &#39;DejaVu Sans&#39;, &#39;Charis SIL&#39;, &#39;Doulos SIL&#39;, &#39;Gentium Plus&#39;, Gentium, GentiumAlt, &#39;Lucida Grande&#39;, &#39;Arial Unicode MS&#39;, sans-serif; font-size: 110%;\">/\u02c8a\u014bko\u02d0ra/</span></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Etimologia_/_Derivazione\"><span id=\"Etimologia_.2F_Derivazione\"></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/40px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/18/Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg/60px-Nuvola_kdict_glass.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span><a href=\"/wiki/etimologia\" title=\"etimologia\">Etimologia</a> / <a href=\"/wiki/derivazione\" title=\"derivazione\">Derivazione</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-etim-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Etimologia / Derivazione\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<dl><dd><i>(avverbio)</i> dal <a href=\"/wiki/latino\" title=\"latino\">latino</a> <i>(ad) hanc horam</i> cio\u00e8 fino \u00aba quest'ora\u00bb</dd>\n<dd><i>(sostantivo)</i> dal <a href=\"/wiki/latino\" title=\"latino\">latino</a> <i><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">anc\u014fra</a></i> che deriva  dal <a href=\"/wiki/greco\" title=\"greco\">greco</a> <i><a href=\"/wiki/%E1%BC%84%CE%B3%CE%BA%CF%85%CF%81%CE%B1\" title=\"\u1f04\u03b3\u03ba\u03c5\u03c1\u03b1\">\u1f04\u03b3\u03ba\u03c5\u03c1\u03b1</a></i> ossia  \u00ab<a href=\"/w/index.php?title=%C3%A0ncora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"\u00e0ncora (la pagina non esiste)\">\u00e0ncora</a>\u00bb a sua volta derivante da <i><a href=\"/wiki/%E1%BC%80%CE%B3%CE%BA%CF%8E%CE%BD\" title=\"\u1f00\u03b3\u03ba\u03ce\u03bd\">\u1f00\u03b3\u03ba\u03ce\u03bd</a></i> ovvero \u00ab<a href=\"/wiki/curvatura\" title=\"curvatura\">curvatura</a>\u00bb</dd></dl>\n<ul><li><i>(voce verbale)</i> vedi <a href=\"/wiki/ancorare#Etimologia_/_Derivazione\" title=\"ancorare\">ancorare</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:auto; background:none; margin-bottom:.5em; font-size:95%; color:#606060; text-align:left\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em; vertical-align:top\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wikiquote-logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\"><img alt=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/20px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/40px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"355\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">\u00abCarissimi, noi din d'ora siamo figli di Dio, ma ci\u00f2 che saremo non \u00e8 stato <b>ancora</b> rivelato.\n\u00bb</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">(<small><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prima_lettera_di_Giovanni\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Prima lettera di Giovanni\">Prima lettera di Giovanni</a>  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.laparola.net/wiki.php?riferimento=1Gv3%2C2&amp;formato_rif=vp\">3,2</a>, testo CEI 2008</small>)</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:auto; background:none; margin-bottom:.5em; font-size:95%; color:#606060; text-align:left\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em; vertical-align:top\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Wikiquote-logo.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\" title=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\"><img alt=\"Collabora a Wikiquote\" src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/20px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"15\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/fa/Wikiquote-logo.svg/40px-Wikiquote-logo.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"300\" data-file-height=\"355\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">\u00abNessuno \u00e8 tanto vecchio da non credere di poter vivere ancora un anno\n\u00bb</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em\">\n</td>\n<td style=\"padding:0 1.2em 0 0\"><div style=\"font-style:normal\">(<small><a href=\"https://it.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cicerone\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:Cicerone\">Cicerone</a></small>)</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Sinonimi\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Icona_sinonimi.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/59/Icona_sinonimi.png/40px-Icona_sinonimi.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"35\" height=\"35\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/59/Icona_sinonimi.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 2x\" data-file-width=\"120\" data-file-height=\"120\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/sinonimi\" title=\"sinonimi\">Sinonimi</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-sin-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Sinonimi\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><b>(avverbio)</b>  <a href=\"/wiki/al_momento\" title=\"al momento\">al momento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/al_presente\" title=\"al presente\">al presente</a>, anche adesso, anche ora, ancora oggi, <a href=\"/wiki/attualmente\" title=\"attualmente\">attualmente</a>, a tutto oggi,  <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=per_il_momento&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"per il momento (la pagina non esiste)\">per il momento</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/presentemente\" title=\"presentemente\">presentemente</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/tuttora\" title=\"tuttora\">tuttora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/daccapo\" title=\"daccapo\">daccapo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/dapprincipio\" title=\"dapprincipio\">dapprincipio</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/di_nuovo\" title=\"di nuovo\">di nuovo</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/nuovamente\" title=\"nuovamente\">nuovamente</a>, un\u2019altra volta</li>\n<li>anche allora, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=fino_allora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"fino allora (la pagina non esiste)\">fino allora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=per_ora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"per ora (la pagina non esiste)\">per ora</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/finora\" title=\"finora\">finora</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/continuamente\" title=\"continuamente\">continuamente</a>,</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/anche\" title=\"anche\">anche</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/perfino\" title=\"perfino\">perfino</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/in_aggiunta\" title=\"in aggiunta\">in aggiunta</a>, <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=di_pi%C3%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"di pi\u00f9 (la pagina non esiste)\">di pi\u00f9</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/inoltre\" title=\"inoltre\">inoltre</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/persino\" title=\"persino\">persino</a>,</li>\n<li><b>(sostantivo)</b> <small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/marina\" title=\"marina\">marina</a></i>)</small>  <a href=\"/wiki/arpione\" title=\"arpione\">arpione</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/ormeggio\" title=\"ormeggio\">ormeggio</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/rampone\" title=\"rampone\">rampone</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Contrari\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fairytale_right_blue.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Fairytale_right_blue.png/20px-Fairytale_right_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/67/Fairytale_right_blue.png/40px-Fairytale_right_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Fairytale_left_blue.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fairytale_left_blue.png/20px-Fairytale_left_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/44/Fairytale_left_blue.png/40px-Fairytale_left_blue.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/contrario\" title=\"contrario\">Contrari</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-ant-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Contrari\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><b>(avverbio)</b> <small>(<i>per estensione</i>)</small> <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=mai_pi%C3%B9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"mai pi\u00f9 (la pagina non esiste)\">mai pi\u00f9</a></li>\n<li><small>(<i><a href=\"/wiki/familiare\" title=\"familiare\">familiare</a></i>)</small> <a href=\"/wiki/basta\" title=\"basta\">basta</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Parole_derivate\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Nuvola_apps_tree.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Nuvola_apps_tree.svg/40px-Nuvola_apps_tree.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3b/Nuvola_apps_tree.svg/60px-Nuvola_apps_tree.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span>  <a href=\"/wiki/parole\" title=\"parole\">Parole</a> <a href=\"/wiki/derivate\" title=\"derivate\">derivate</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-der-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Parole derivate\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><i>(avverbio)</i> <a href=\"/wiki/ancorch%C3%A9\" title=\"ancorch\u00e9\">ancorch\u00e9</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/financo\" title=\"financo\">financo</a></li>\n<li><i>(sostantivo)</i> <a href=\"/wiki/ancorare\" title=\"ancorare\">ancorare</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/ancorato\" title=\"ancorato\">ancorato</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/disancorare\" title=\"disancorare\">disancorare</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/ancoraggio\" title=\"ancoraggio\">ancoraggio</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Proverbi_e_modi_di_dire\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Isimple_system_icons_web_find.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Isimple_system_icons_web_find.png/40px-Isimple_system_icons_web_find.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d6/Isimple_system_icons_web_find.png/60px-Isimple_system_icons_web_find.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/proverbio\" title=\"proverbio\">Proverbi</a> e <a href=\"/wiki/modo_di_dire\" title=\"modo di dire\">modi di dire</a></h3><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=Template:-prov-&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Modifica la sezione Proverbi e modi di dire\"><span>modifica</span></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></div>\n<ul><li><i>(avverbio)</i> <i>Chi di una <a href=\"/wiki/donna\" title=\"donna\">donna</a> brutta s'innamora, <a href=\"/wiki/lieto\" title=\"lieto\">lieto</a> con essa invecchia e l'ama <b>ancora</b><small></small></i></li></ul>\n<ul><li><i>(sostantivo)</i> <i><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ancora_di_salvezza&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ancora di salvezza (la pagina non esiste)\">ancora di salvezza</a></i>: estremo rimedio</li>\n<li><i>(sostantivo)</i> <i><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=gettare_l%27ancora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"gettare l&#39;ancora (la pagina non esiste)\">gettare l'ancora</a></i>: fermarsi</li>\n<li><i>(sostantivo)</i> <i><a href=\"/w/index.php?title=levare_l%27ancora&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"levare l&#39;ancora (la pagina non esiste)\">levare l'ancora</a></i>: partire</li></ul>\n<div class=\"mw-heading mw-heading3\"><h3 id=\"Traduzione\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Gnome-globe.svg\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/40px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"//upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f3/Gnome-globe.svg/60px-Gnome-globe.svg.png?utm_source=it.wiktionary.org&amp;utm_campaign=parser&amp;utm_content=thumbnail 2x\" data-file-width=\"48\" data-file-height=\"48\" /></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/traduzione\" title=\"traduzione\">Traduzione</a></h3></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"Mostra\" data-collapsetext=\"Nascondi\" style=\"padding:0.2em 0.6em 0.2em 0.6em; border-right:1px solid #BEBEBE; border-bottom:1px dotted black; background:#EDEDED; color:#000;\">avverbio, di nuovo\n<div class=\"z-index:-1; toccolours mw-collapsible-content\" style=\"border:0;\">\n<table border=\"0\" width=\"100%\" class=\"translations\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"beige\" valign=\"top\" width=\"48%\">\n<dl><dd><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/catalano\" title=\"catalano\">catalano</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=encara&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"encara (la pagina non esiste)\">encara</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/cinese\" title=\"cinese\">cinese</a>: <small><i>(con riferimento al passato)</i></small> <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8F%88\" title=\"\u53c8\">\u53c8</a> (y\u00f2u), <small><i>(con riferimento al futuro)</i></small> <a href=\"/wiki/%E5%86%8D\" title=\"\u518d\">\u518d</a> (z\u00e0i)</li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/esperanto\" title=\"esperanto\">esperanto</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=ankora%C5%AD&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"ankora\u016d (la pagina non esiste)\">ankora\u016d</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/finlandese\" title=\"finlandese\">finlandese</a>: <a href=\"/w/index.php?title=viel%C3%A4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"viel\u00e4 (la pag